WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.957
<v DANA>Here's a quick story about a needle that
ended up in the regular trash. We'll let

00:00:04.957 --> 00:00:06.320
<v DANA>Jacob tell this story.

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:10.400
<v Boyd >Hey, my name's Jacob, and I work on the
sanitation crew.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:14.720
<v Boyd >It's the end of the day, and I'm pulling
the bag out of the bin by the line.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:19.520
<v Boyd >I tie it off and lift it, and something
jabs me right through the plastic.

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:24.347
<v Boyd >I look down, and there's a needle
sticking out the side of the bag. I never

00:00:24.347 --> 00:00:26.800
<v Boyd >even saw it but it poked into my leg.

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:31.360
<v DANA>Ok, that's terrible. So where did that
needle come from?

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:35.875
<v RAY>It came from Chris, who works on the
line. He manages his diabetes with

00:00:35.875 --> 00:00:36.400
<v RAY>insulin.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.600
<v DANA>So how does his needle end up in the
trash?

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:44.123
<v RAY>One afternoon he's in the middle of a
task, and he can't find a sharps

00:00:44.123 --> 00:00:49.040
<v RAY>container nearby. So, just this ONCE, he
drops the used needle in the trash.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:53.756
<v DANA>You know, I can picture doing that.
You're busy, and the trash is right

00:00:53.756 --> 00:00:54.160
<v DANA>there.

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:58.000
<v RAY>And it's only one time, so it doesn't
feel like a big deal.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.760
<v DANA>But what about Jacob?

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:04.846
<v RAY>Jacob never used that needle, and he
never saw it until it went through the

00:01:04.846 --> 00:01:10.000
<v RAY>bag. And a needlestick can expose you to
H-I-V, hepatitis B and hepatitis C.

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:13.120
<v DANA>And all he did was take out the trash.

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:18.045
<v RAY>[quietly] That's the part that gets me.
Chris made the choice, but Jacob is the

00:01:18.045 --> 00:01:19.200
<v RAY>one who got stuck.

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:23.680
<v RAY>You know, a sharp in the wrong place can
hurt someone who never HANDLED it.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:26.960
<v DANA>The last bag you filled at work... who
picked it up?

